{"candidate_id": "195049bc6b615cd5d203", "instruction": "已知在某市的一次学情检测中, 学生的数学成绩 $X$ 服从正态分布 $\\mathrm{N}(100,100)$, 其中 90 分为及格线, 120 分为优秀线. 下列说法正确的是 ( )\n\n附: 随机变量 $\\xi$ 服从正态分布 $N\\left(u, \\sigma^{2}\\right)$, 则 $P(\\mu-\\sigma<\\xi<u+\\sigma)=0.6826$, $P(\\mu-2 \\sigma<\\xi<\\mu+2 \\sigma)=0.9544, \\quad P(u-3 \\sigma<\\xi<\\mu+3 \\sigma)=0.9974$\nA. 该市学生数学成绩的期望为 100\nB. 该市学生数学成绩的标准差为 100\nC. 该市学生数学成绩及格率超过", "reasoning": "已知成绩X~N(100,100)，故μ=100，σ²=100，σ=10。\nA：期望即μ=100，正确。\nB：标准差为10，不是100，错误。\nC：及格线90=μ-σ，P(X≥90)=1-P(X<μ-σ)=1-(1-0.6826)/2=1-0.1587=0.8413，即84.13%，超过84%，正确。\n故正确选项为A、C。", "answer": "AC", "source": "EduChat-Math", "original_sft_token_length": 4787, "compressed_reasoning_tokens": 137, "compressed_sft_tokens": 373, "teacher_model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "verifier_model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "verifier": {"valid": true, "supports_answer": true, "missing_key_step": false, "error": ""}, "usage": [{"stage": "compress", "attempt": 1, "prompt_tokens": 4433, "completion_tokens": 149, "total_tokens": 4582, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4433}, {"stage": "verify", "attempt": 1, "prompt_tokens": 458, "completion_tokens": 29, "total_tokens": 487, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 458}], "stage2_finalize_reasons": ["near_eval_duplicate"]}
{"candidate_id": "f0d2b91feba9541f91b6", "instruction": "21. (2019 天津理 19) 设 $\\left\\{a_{n}\\right\\}$ 是等差数列, $\\left\\{b_{n}\\right\\}$ 是等比数列. 已知 $a_{1}=4, b_{1}=6, b_{2}=2 a_{2}-2, b_{3}=2 a_{3}+4$.\n\n(I) 求 $\\left\\{a_{n}\\right\\}$ 和 $\\left\\{b_{n}\\right\\}$ 的通项公式;\n\n(II) 设数列 $\\left\\{c_{n}\\right\\}$ 满足 $c_{1}=1, c_{n}=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}1,2^{k}<n<2^{k+1} \\\\ b_{k}, n=2^{k},\\end{array}\\right.$ 其中 $k \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*}$.\n\n(i) 求数列 $\\left\\{a_{2^{n}}\\left(c_{2^{n}}-1\\right)\\right\\}$ 的通项公式;\n\n(ii) 求 $\\sum_{i=1}^{2^{n}} a_{i} c_{i} \\quad\\left(n \\in \\mathbf{N}^{*}\\right)$.\n", "reasoning": "设等差数列公差为d，等比数列公比为q。由a₁=4得a₂=4+d，a₃=4+2d；由b₁=6得b₂=6q，b₃=6q²。根据条件：6q=2(4+d)-2=6+2d，6q²=2(4+2d)+4=12+4d。化简得3q=3+d，3q²=6+2d。消去d得3q²-6q=0，解得q=2（q=0舍去），代入得d=3。故aₙ=3n+1，bₙ=6·2ⁿ⁻¹=3·2ⁿ。\n\n(II)(i) 由cₙ定义，当n=2ᵏ时cₙ=bₖ，故c_{2ⁿ}=bₙ。所求数列通项为a_{2ⁿ}(c_{2ⁿ}-1)=(3·2ⁿ+1)(3·2ⁿ-1)=9·4ⁿ-1。\n\n(II)(ii) 求和∑_{i=1}^{2ⁿ}aᵢcᵢ。当i不是2的幂时cᵢ=1，当i=2ᵏ(k=1,…,n)时cᵢ=bₖ。故原式=∑_{i=1}^{2ⁿ}aᵢ + ∑_{k=1}^{n}a_{2ᵏ}(bₖ-1)。\n计算∑_{i=1}^{2ⁿ}aᵢ：aᵢ=3i+1，前m=2ⁿ项和为m(4+3m+1)/2=2ⁿ⁻¹(3·2ⁿ+5)。\n计算∑_{k=1}^{n}a_{2ᵏ}(bₖ-1)：a_{2ᵏ}=3·2ᵏ+1，bₖ-1=3·2ᵏ-1，乘积为9·4ᵏ-1。求和得9·(4ⁿ⁺¹-4)/3 - n = 3·4ⁿ⁺¹-12-n。\n总和=2ⁿ⁻¹(3·2ⁿ+5)+3·4ⁿ⁺¹-12-n=3·2²ⁿ⁻¹+5·2ⁿ⁻¹+3·2²ⁿ⁺²-12-n=27·2²ⁿ⁻¹+5·2ⁿ⁻¹-12-n=(27·4ⁿ+5·2ⁿ)/2-12-n=(27·4ⁿ+5·2ⁿ-24-2n)/2。", "answer": "\\dfrac{27 \\cdot 4^n + 5 \\cdot 2^n - 24 - 2n}{2}", "source": "EduChat-Math", "original_sft_token_length": 8353, "compressed_reasoning_tokens": 598, "compressed_sft_tokens": 942, "teacher_model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "verifier_model": "deepseek-v4-pro", "verifier": {"valid": true, "supports_answer": true, "missing_key_step": false, "error": ""}, "usage": [{"stage": "compress", "attempt": 1, "prompt_tokens": 7930, "completion_tokens": 649, "total_tokens": 8579, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 7930}, {"stage": "verify", "attempt": 1, "prompt_tokens": 1033, "completion_tokens": 29, "total_tokens": 1062, "prompt_tokens_details